#: apps/selfservice/templates/selfservice/recent_changes.html:6
msgid ""
"Readings and contact details members changed through their personal links, "
"newest first."
msgstr ""
"Avläsningar och kontaktuppgifter som medlemmar har ändrat via sina "
"personliga länkar, senast först."

#: apps/selfservice/templates/selfservice/recent_changes.html:40
